                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a12d6d53-470b-3f1f-b63a-79d37a9b2c73",
                                        "entry_id": "2236baae-badf-3d1b-bd51-aabce320e054",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A miscarriage; an untimely birth; an abortion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78737d5f-3e18-4fa4-a388-e2a4affd67b2",
                                                "sense_id": "a12d6d53-470b-3f1f-b63a-79d37a9b2c73",
                                                "text": "In Japonia 'tis a common thing to stifle their children if they be poor, or to make an abort, which Aristotle commends."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "abort",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90c5fb65-1b9a-3e2a-ac39-c72faa0e3515",
                                        "entry_id": "89da7bee-30d2-3f85-8180-9ea0ec7642bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To miscarry; to bring forth (non-living) offspring prematurely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "regional"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "062c5592-bf45-42cc-97e2-c1d4a7d5ebb2",
                                                "sense_id": "90c5fb65-1b9a-3e2a-ac39-c72faa0e3515",
                                                "text": "Women have aborted, men have committed suicide, and both men and women have been thrown into convulsions during the fearful agony of renal colic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6cd3246-795e-4959-a316-1b49a48acec1",
                                                "sense_id": "90c5fb65-1b9a-3e2a-ac39-c72faa0e3515",
                                                "text": "In the study group ll patients aborted spontaneously between the 17th and 20th gestational week and 8 patients aborted after the 21st week."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62a36ca3-f8c6-3e1e-a452-27dd7ceb1d70",
                                        "entry_id": "89da7bee-30d2-3f85-8180-9ea0ec7642bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause a premature termination of (a fetus); to end a pregnancy before term."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "309c00ec-b81c-416e-8634-c68ccf02ca15",
                                                "sense_id": "62a36ca3-f8c6-3e1e-a452-27dd7ceb1d70",
                                                "text": "\"Of course, you can't abort yourself...I mean you positively can't be allowed to. To begin with it's a crime.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1fe089d-af91-35b5-a54c-0952a908f887",
                                        "entry_id": "89da7bee-30d2-3f85-8180-9ea0ec7642bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To end prematurely; to stop in the preliminary stages; to turn back."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86ad04ca-74c5-3980-979a-6e1f20d925fd",
                                        "entry_id": "89da7bee-30d2-3f85-8180-9ea0ec7642bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To stop or fail at something in the preliminary stages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33d7e56b-09ca-3d62-94ce-ef5a47426427",
                                        "entry_id": "89da7bee-30d2-3f85-8180-9ea0ec7642bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become checked in normal development, so as either to remain rudimentary or shrink away wholly; to cease organic growth before maturation; to become sterile."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f6e241c0-06e6-311e-b40e-578d3d049291",
                                        "entry_id": "89da7bee-30d2-3f85-8180-9ea0ec7642bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause an organism to develop minimally; to cause rudimentary development to happen; to prevent maturation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75db9a73-e917-3204-834d-b8c8d1c5b79a",
                                        "entry_id": "89da7bee-30d2-3f85-8180-9ea0ec7642bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To abandon a mission at any point after the beginning of the mission and prior to its completion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dddd8a70-cef5-465b-ad38-e4b1cfe40161",
                                                "sense_id": "75db9a73-e917-3204-834d-b8c8d1c5b79a",
                                                "text": "First he aborts the take-off and now we have a runway incursion!"
                                            }
